Step B is the vector path for data:image/svg+xml in walk() case 'IMG' / imageNode():
1. Use it only when src starts with 'data:image/svg+xml', S.opts.images is set, and cs.objectFit is 'fill', 'contain' or 'scale-down'. Leave cover/none on the raster path.
2. Decode synchronously. Take the payload after the first ','. If the header contains ';base64', use new TextDecoder().decode(Uint8Array.from(atob(p), c => c.charCodeAt(0))); otherwise use decodeURIComponent(p). Parse with new DOMParser().parseFromString(text, 'image/svg+xml'). If the result has a <parsererror> or the root is not <svg>, fall back to raster.
